WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:02.830
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.760
Today I am going to explain a Malaysian comedy
film called “Beautiful World.”

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.050
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:16.240
Watch out and take care!

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:20.270
The movie begins in an elementary school in
China where a doctor is weighing the students

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.400
for an annual weight checkup.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.910
In the modern world, the beauty standard has
changed and fat people are considered more

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.800
beautiful and appealing than skinny ones.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:34.840
The doctor praises a boy named Zhen Pang for
weighing the most out of everyone.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:39.300
Zhen Pang also holds the record for being
the fattest one in their class for the past

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.730
five years.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:45.790
The nurses set him as an example and ask the
others to eat with dedication and be as fat

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:46.860
as him.

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:49.730
After school, Zhen Pang’s mother comes to
pick him up.

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:55.329
The parents of other kids compliment his mother
for her and Zhen Pang’s outstanding weight.

00:00:55.329 --> 00:01:00.100
One of the mothers is worried for her daughter,
Tiantian because she is too thin.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:03.699
It turns out that no one wants to marry thin
people in this world.

00:01:03.699 --> 00:01:08.970
However, Zhen Pang compliments Tiantian claiming
that she is thin and pretty.

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:13.079
He is unlike everyone else as he doesn't see
fat people as beautiful.

00:01:13.079 --> 00:01:17.270
While returning home, Zhen Pang says that
he wants to lose weight because he cannot

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:19.659
even see his toes while standing up.

00:01:19.659 --> 00:01:22.659
He thinks that being fat is ugly and dumb.

00:01:22.659 --> 00:01:27.250
The kid insists that he would rather fly like
a bird than waddle around like a pig.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:32.060
This makes his mother angry, who scolds him
for being unlike everyone else in the world.

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:37.869
One day at school, Zhen Pang sees some kids
bullying Tiantian, for being skinny and ugly.

00:01:37.869 --> 00:01:41.960
He chases them away but Tiantian doesn’t
appreciate his kindness.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:45.659
She believes that he is being sarcastic by
calling her pretty.

00:01:45.659 --> 00:01:50.909
When Zhen Pang insists that she is beautiful,
Tiantian hits him and walks away.

00:01:50.909 --> 00:01:53.439
Several years have passed since the incident.

00:01:53.439 --> 00:01:57.479
The world hasn’t changed a bit as being
fat is still the beauty standard.

00:01:57.479 --> 00:02:02.189
All the models on magazine covers, famous
actors, and singers are fat.

00:02:02.189 --> 00:02:06.509
But Zhen Pang has grown up into a skinny adult
who owns a donut shop.

00:02:06.509 --> 00:02:10.739
He is low on customers because his donuts
are not classified according to their calories

00:02:10.739 --> 00:02:12.850
and are made of healthy fruits.

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:17.810
His mother is always worried about him and
the shop because Zhen Pang goes against societal

00:02:17.810 --> 00:02:20.959
norms and doesn’t care if people think he
is thin.

00:02:20.959 --> 00:02:25.670
She urges him to use more sugar in his donuts
but Zhen Pang is persistent about wanting

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:27.459
to make his products healthy.

00:02:27.459 --> 00:02:32.420
Zhen Pang’s girlfriend Manco is also thin
and believes she is ugly.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:37.110
She goes to “fattening classes” where
a lady teaches them to eat as unhealthy as

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:38.110
possible.

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:42.760
They are told that the heavier a woman is,
the more space she can take in a man’s heart.

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:48.450
Manco is distressed because she has only gained
0.5kgs in three months, unlike her classmates

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:54.810
who gained 30kgs.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:58.950
To motivate her, the teacher reminds her of
the discrimination against thin people in

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:00.020
society.

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:04.870
She even gives a heartfelt speech on how she
wanted to harm herself because she was too

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:05.870
skinny.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:09.609
After the class, Manco and her skinny friend
go to a restaurant and try to eat as much

00:03:09.609 --> 00:03:10.690
as they can.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:15.180
But halfway through the meal, Manco gets sick
and has to be taken to the hospital.

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:19.409
Zhen Pang comes to see her and assures her
she is pretty even though she is thin.

00:03:19.409 --> 00:03:24.700
Manco’s day gets worse when the doctor advises
her to eat light foods for the next week.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:28.189
After returning home, she complains about
not being able to gain weight.

00:03:28.189 --> 00:03:33.010
Zhen Pang asks her to quit the fattening program
because it is making her sick but Manco flat

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:34.269
out refuses.

00:03:34.269 --> 00:03:38.329
In their next fattening class, Manco and her
friend are kicked out of the program because

00:03:38.329 --> 00:03:40.310
they give it a bad reputation.

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:47.500
The organizers do not want skinny girls to
represent them.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:51.569
The girls retaliate but the teacher claims
there is no hope for them to gain weight and

00:03:51.569 --> 00:03:52.870
become beautiful.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:56.480
Manco and her friend walk outside the facility
in disappointment.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:00.590
Her friend’s boyfriend has refused to marry
her unless she gains weight.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:05.499
She jumps in front of a running car to commit
suicide when suddenly, a handsome fat man

00:04:05.499 --> 00:04:08.730
stops the car with his bare hands and saves
her.

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:12.560
The man turns out to be the creator of the
fattening program, Simon.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.750
He sends Manco’s friend home safely.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:18.950
And even asks the lady who just kicked them
out, to enroll them back in the program.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:23.389
According to him, the institution is made
for skinny women who want to feel beautiful.

00:04:23.389 --> 00:04:26.410
Manco is visibly impressed by the boss’s
kindness.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:30.840
When the two are alone, he apologizes to her
for the employee’s behavior.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:35.710
Before leaving, he hands her his business
card, asking her to call him anytime.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:40.610
Following that, Manco meets Zhen Pang but
ignores him completely and is too focused

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:41.680
on her phone.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:46.199
Zhen Pang feels like her girlfriend will leave
him after gaining weight but Manco dismisses

00:04:46.199 --> 00:04:47.590
the conversation.

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:51.699
The next day is a launch party of the fattening
program’s next products.

00:04:51.699 --> 00:04:55.480
Manco’s classmates who have enrolled in
the program alongside her, are on the stage

00:04:55.480 --> 00:05:00.270
showing their progress while Manco and her
friend are serving drinks to the guests.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:05.580
Everyone is waiting for a superstar model
Debbie who is the honorary guest of the launch.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:09.460
Manco approaches Simon and his friends and
hands him a special drink.

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:13.710
Simon introduces her to his friends as a new
talent who will surely gain weight in the

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:14.710
next three months.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:19.569
But as soon as she leaves, we find out that
it was his idea to kick them out of the program.

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:24.080
When he realized the girls resorted to suicide,
he pretended to be on their side to avoid

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.539
a potential lawsuit.

00:05:25.539 --> 00:05:29.410
The table makes fun of Manco’s weight calling
her a bamboo stick.

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:33.930
In the following scene, we are introduced
to superstar Debbie, who turns out to be Zhen

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.789
Pang’s former classmate Tiantian.

00:05:36.789 --> 00:05:40.740
Because of her bullies, she made it her mission
to gain weight and be the prettiest version

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:41.910
of herself.

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:46.960
She is now a top Chinese model and hates Zhen
Pang for sarcastically calling her beautiful

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:48.379
when she was young.

00:05:48.379 --> 00:05:52.370
She makes a grand entrance into the venue
leaving everyone in awe.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:56.630
Zhen Pang, on the other hand, is backstage
delivering donuts for the party.

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:59.680
He decides to wait for Manco until the event
ends.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:04.690
Inside, Debbie gives a heartfelt speech on
how she was bullied while in school.

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:09.470
After the event, Debbie leaves after telling
Simon that the donuts were awful.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:13.050
Manco and her friend say goodbye to Simon
and the others but the group insists they

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:14.440
stay for a drink.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:18.610
Manco agrees, not knowing that her boyfriend
is waiting for her outside.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:23.190
As the conversation continues, it is evident
that Manco is jealous of the other fat girl

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.930
getting closer to Simon.

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:27.770
They place a bet on who can drink more alcohol.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:30.830
Driven by jealousy, Manco drinks several glasses.

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:34.569
The men enjoy the competition and ask them
to eat the donuts as well.

00:06:34.569 --> 00:06:38.710
When Manco starts getting nauseous, one of
Simon’s friends shoves a donut into her

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.710
throat.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:44.129
Zhen Pang, who has just entered the venue
sees this and pushes the man away from his

00:06:44.129 --> 00:06:49.419
girlfriend.

00:06:49.419 --> 00:06:53.439
He gets into a fight with them and calls their
fattening program a scam.

00:06:53.439 --> 00:06:57.639
Things get heated when he pushes Simon for
joking about the situation.

00:06:57.639 --> 00:07:00.509
An angered Simon kicks both of them out of
the venue.

00:07:00.509 --> 00:07:04.660
As they leave, the group makes fun of the
couple saying that they look like a pair of

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:07.870
chopsticks.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:11.169
Zhen Pang takes Manco to a restaurant to calm
her down.

00:07:11.169 --> 00:07:15.849
She is furious at him for ruining the only
good thing that was going on in her life.

00:07:15.849 --> 00:07:20.140
She says that she has never found him attractive
and was in a relationship with him only because

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:21.680
he was skinny like her.

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:24.800
Before leaving, Manco declares that they have
broken up.

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:29.889
A sad Zhen Pang sluggishly makes his way outside
but a metal billboard advertising the fattening

00:07:29.889 --> 00:07:32.620
program falls on him, knocking him out.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.530
The impact causes Zhen Pang to go into a coma.

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:40.350
His mother, furious at everyone who led her
son to the hospital bed, decides to sue the

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.439
fattening company.

00:07:41.439 --> 00:07:45.060
Soon, Simon and his employees get a letter
from her lawyer.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:49.860
The media finds out about the news and criticizes
the company for making faulty billboards that

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.680
put common people’s lives in danger.

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:56.659
Since the billboard had Debbie’s picture
on it, she too gets backlash from the media

00:07:56.659 --> 00:07:58.610
for supporting such brands.

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:02.910
She and her assistant look for a way to turn
the hate she is getting on social media and

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:06.900
find out the victim is her elementary school
bully, Zhen Pang.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:10.689
The very next day, Debbie brings a bouquet
of flowers to the hospital.

00:08:10.689 --> 00:08:14.490
She meets Zhen Pang’s mother and introduces
herself as Tiantian.

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:18.409
The woman is surprised to see the skinny little
girl from elementary school who has changed

00:08:18.409 --> 00:08:20.469
into a beautiful fat woman.

00:08:20.469 --> 00:08:24.909
Debbie compliments her figure and wins Zhen
Pang’s mother with her kindness.

00:08:24.909 --> 00:08:29.530
She even transfers Zhen Pang to the VIP room
as an apology for endorsing the fattening

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.670
program.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:34.930
But when she is alone with her assistant,
she reveals that she helped them only because

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:38.690
she wanted the media to portray her as a kind-hearted
celebrity.

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:43.630
Moreover, she wants Zhen Pang to gain consciousness
so she could take revenge for how he treated

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:44.830
her in school.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:48.170
The next day, Debbie visits Zhen Pang early
in the morning.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:52.080
She hits him in the face and jumps on top
of him to take her revenge.

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:56.020
But her plan fails when the impact brings
him back to consciousness.

00:08:56.020 --> 00:09:00.030
Zhen Pang is shocked to see her but doesn’t
voice his surprise.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:03.840
After he is discharged from the hospital,
Debbie starts visiting their donut shop every

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:05.680
day to meet his mother.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:10.430
She also agrees to taste test the donuts until
they live up to her standard and offers to

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:11.910
be their brand ambassador.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:16.310
Zhen Pang brings her to a private area and
asks her why she is being too nice to his

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:19.660
family when it is clear that she has always
hated him.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:23.510
Debbie gets emotional and tells him how much
he affected her childhood.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:27.830
As she yells at him to apologize, she falls
unconscious on the ground.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:31.940
The doctor tells Zhen Pang that Debbie has
several health issues because of her size

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:34.430
but she refuses to lose weight.

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:39.630
If she continues to overeat, she will most
likely get heart disease and die at an early

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:40.630
age.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:45.010
Zhen Pang feels bad for Debbie and wants to
help her, but he doesn’t know how.

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:48.400
Debbie is bothered by her losing 5 kgs in
a week.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:53.220
She wants to get back to being 90kgs before
the shooting of her debut film starts.

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:57.870
For that, she brings out an illegal weight-increasing
medicine that the doctor has asked her to

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.140
stay away from.

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:03.620
Her assistant tries to warn her against it
but Debbie takes the medicine anyway.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:07.280
As a side effect, she gets severe rashes in
her back.

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:12.410
The next day, she goes to a radio show to
talk to fans and motivate them to eat more.

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:18.800
Zhen Pang listens to the program and calls
them under the name donut.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:23.030
He expresses his view on the trend and claims
that the size of your body should not determine

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:25.040
your worth in society.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:29.250
He also shares that he used to be a fat kid
but now is skinny.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:33.070
Knowing that it is him on the phone, Debbie
visits his shop later.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:36.900
They get into a heated argument but Debbie
feels dizzy in the middle.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:40.130
Zhen Pang brings her in and offers her a cup
of tea.

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:44.810
He calmly explains to her that her health
is more important than any kind of beauty

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:45.910
contest.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:50.520
Before leaving, Debbie asks him if she can
really ignore people’s words and live life

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:51.960
how she wants to.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:55.780
Zhen Pang says that he has been doing the
same his whole life.

00:10:55.780 --> 00:11:00.330
Starting the next day, he meets her every
day and helps her eat less by eating all of

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:02.130
her food himself.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:04.860
After the meal, the two talk about their love
lives.

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:09.370
Debbie understands Zhen Pang for the first
time and starts to like him.

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:14.350
One day, Zhen Pang’s mother informs him
that Debbie had to be rushed to the hospital

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:16.950
after she overdosed on fattening drugs.

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:21.120
Zhen Pang quickly rushes to her house and
finds out from her assistant that the news

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:24.930
was fake but it has affected Debbie’s reputation
harshly.

00:11:24.930 --> 00:11:28.620
Later, he finds her crying alone and talks
to her.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:32.720
Debbie expresses her feelings to him and feels
a lot lighter after talking.

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:36.270
At last, Zhen Pang carries her home on her
back.

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:38.690
A year passes after the incident.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:42.340
Debbie took a break from modeling and worked
on improving her health.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:46.080
She has turned skinny and way healthier than
she was a year ago.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:50.520
Her assistant wants her to visit Zhen Pang
because it is evident that she misses him.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:54.640
Debbie agrees and gets out of her apartment
for the first time in a year.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:57.210
She goes to the park bench and sits alone.

00:11:57.210 --> 00:12:01.380
To her surprise, Zhen Pang appears out of
nowhere sits beside her.

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:05.760
He doesn’t seem to recognize her at first
but then, hands her a donut and calls her

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:10.390
Tiantian.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:13.880
Debbie is delighted that he recognized her
even after all this time.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:23.870
The movie ends as they playfully fight by
the lake.

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:28.150
